    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκολῐότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crookedness</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῆς
			καμπῆς</span>, of a Parthian bow, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				24
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>the windings</i> of a stream, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.2.19
			</span></i>; of <i>windings</i> generally, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				12.8.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>inequality</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκολιότητα ἔχειν</span>
			<i>to be unequally affected</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
			</span></i>(<u>Sp.</u>)<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of men,
				<i>crookedness, dishonesty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				16.5
			</span></i>.</div>
